{"format":"callayers","version":2,"title":"Untitled","scenes":[{"elements":[{"type":"card","id":"{FE2E7832-0D20-4CD7-912A-F908265302BD}","html":"<style>*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body,.card{margin:0;height:100%;font-family:Segoe UI,sans-serif;color:#fff}.card{padding:36px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6755c6,#37276e);border-radius:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;overflow:hidden}p{margin:0;font-size:clamp(16px,3.2vw,26px);color:#ded6ff}h1{margin:12px 0;font-size:clamp(30px,6.8vw,62px);line-height:1.05}.bottom{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.clock{font-size:clamp(28px,6vw,54px);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.track{height:8px;background:#ffffff25;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:24px}.bar{width:25%;height:100%;background:#c7f3d6;animation:slide 2s ease-in-out infinite alternate}@keyframes slide{to{transform:translateX(300%)}}</style><div class=\"card\"><p>CALLAYERS · LIVE HTML</p><h1>Ideas in motion.</h1><div><div class=\"bottom\"><p>Move me without restarting.<br>Resize me to change my layout.</p><span class=\"clock\" id=\"clock\">0.0s</span></div><div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\"></div></div></div></div><script>const started=performance.now();setInterval(()=>{document.getElementById('clock').textContent=((performance.now()-started)/1000).toFixed(1)+'s'},100)</script>\n<style data-callayers=\"transparent-style\">.card{background:rgba(36,23,64,.16);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);color:#fff;text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.95),0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.7)}p,h1,.clock{color:#fff}.dot{background:#baf2cd}.track{background:rgba(255,255,255,.16)}</style>","x":0.04642857142857143,"y":0.15746268656716417,"width":0.47252100840336136,"height":0.575},{"type":"card","id":"{6287D5BC-DD98-454A-AAF1-867DABBC0721}","html":"<style>*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body,.card{margin:0;height:100%;font-family:Georgia;color:#16382c}.card{padding:28px;background:#baf2cd;border-radius:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}h1{font-size:clamp(24px,7vw,58px);margin:8px 0}p{font-size:clamp(16px,4vw,28px);margin:0}.dot{display:inline-block;width:18px;height:18px;background:#28764b;border-radius:50%;animation:pulse 1s infinite alternate}@keyframes pulse{to{opacity:.2;transform:scale(.6)}}</style><div class=\"card\"><p><span class=\"dot\"></span> A separate card</p><h1>Its own style.</h1><p>Resize me. My layout responds.</p></div>\n<style data-callayers=\"transparent-style\">.card{background:rgba(16,48,36,.16);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);color:#fff;text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.95),0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.7)}p,h1,.clock{color:#fff}.dot{background:#baf2cd}.track{background:rgba(255,255,255,.16)}</style>","x":0.665,"y":0.225,"width":0.27,"height":0.3}]}]}